# Deep Learning Midterm Project

## Overview
This project contains coursework, analysis, and evaluations completed during the midterm portion of the Deep Learning & Artificial Intelligence course.
Dataset Information

This project uses Fitbit-inspired fitness tracking data.

Features include:
- Daily steps
- Calories burned
- Activity intensity
- Sleep metrics
- Heart rate indicators

Preprocessing Steps:
- Missing value handling
- Duplicate removal
- Feature engineering
- Data normalization

The dataset was used to train machine learning models for fitness prediction and recommendation generation.
